<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-bayou-sludge" category="High Gain" order="130" instrument="guitar" style="Sludge">
  <description>Filthy Southern sludge: a metal pedal with its distortion at zero and level up, slamming a British valve head into heavy saturation, into a V30 4x12, dry. Mid-heavy, nasty and loud; downtune, hold the chord and let it howl into feedback.</description>
